"Nothing Helm runs can hang. Homebrew, the VPN list and the power settings are read by running the system's own tools, and a tool that was talkative enough about its own warnings could stop forever, taking the screen waiting for it with it." = "Rien de ce que Helm exécute ne peut se figer. Un outil suffisamment bavard sur ses avertissements pouvait s’arrêter indéfiniment et bloquer l’écran qui l’attendait.";
